  heading="Bones before blocks: how I set up Strive’s component registry"
  eyebrow="Strivelabs engineering · Design systems"
  published="2026-10-08"
  publishedLabel="October 2026"
  keywords="component registry, component library, design systems, shadcn/ui, Radix, Tailwind, tsup, tsdown, Rolldown, monorepo, pnpm workspaces, Turborepo, React, design engineering, Strive"
